ashi (the aggressor) forced his way into it. Kimiyuki's hair color can be either black or blonde. If he has black hair, it will be the same as it is now, even when he was a student. I will leave the situation up to you. Thank you very much in advance! https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-KZkxBO51gm8FGZGT54gL9gzLXFhTp39", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@sanbaizoo333/works/69", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1999655, "client_id": 2548259, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/37479077/uploads/origins/43662d14-19e4-4b8b-8ddf-181db0ae351a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c36a11d6987d8e867cdabcd0920dc3e5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/37479077/uploads/origins/43662d14-19e4-4b8b-8ddf-181db0ae351a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c36a11d6987d8e867cdabcd0920dc3e5, https://si.imgix.net/37479077/uploads/origins/43662d14-19e4-4b8b-8ddf-181db0ae351a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=96a6df6f1d83b0c1867a88739f84d46b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/37479077/uploads/origins/43662d14-19e4-4b8b-8ddf-181db0ae351a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=97fa791c7e24b6a30ddf40464b6d5293 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/37479077/uploads/origins/43662d14-19e4-4b8b-8ddf-181db0ae351a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1664826cd52252c0bedeb76b0eb48b5f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/37479077/uploads/origins/43662d14-19e4-4b8b-8ddf-181db0ae351a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1664826cd52252c0bedeb76b0eb48b5f, https://si.imgix.net/37479077/uploads/origins/43662d14-19e4-4b8b-